==Description==
The '''Mummy''' was the second enemy that appeared in the [[Solar Eclipse Event]]. It was faster and had higher health than the [[Undead (Solar Eclipse)|Undead]].

==Appearance==
Bandages were wrapped around the '''Mummy''', which covered most of its body, exposing only some of its arms and its head. Its torso and legs were cobblestone. Its neck was covered with a white neckguard. It had green skin and was faceless. Its head was tilted slightly downwards.

==Strategy==
*Towers that deal splash damage, such as the [[Mortar]] and [[Ace Pilot]], can be useful against this due to their splash damage.
**The [[Swarmer]] can also be useful against this, as it can damage multiple enemies at once with its ''Beehive Grenade'' ability.
*Cheap towers with high DPS like the [[Crook Boss]] or [[Minigunner]] can do well against these.
**Additionally, you can use [[Commander]] and [[DJ Booth]] to boost these towers' firerate and range, respectively.
**Do note that the low cash supply in [[Rotfield]] may limit the potential of these towers.

